== I had a dream

#poem[][

He dreams that he walked into his office and saw his monitor spilling\
out the code from all of his projects, first onto the keyboard,\
then the chair, and onto the floor, making the sound of either\
Lego bricks or Scrabble tiles.

He fetches a bucket to catch the last of the\
code as it falls out. He spends some time scooping the\
rest of the bits into the bucket. As he turns to leave, he swore\
he heard his monitor heaving quietly, 

He turns\
back\
runs his hand over the top of the screen\
says, "There there, it's ok. It's over now; nothing left."

][0]